### Get all categories
GET {{baseUrl}}?search=&orderBy=name&orderType=desc&page=1&perPage=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenSuperAdmin}}


### Get category by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/3c2d0f25-38c4-42d1-8f60-d1dcf1c28ae2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenSuperAdmin}}


### Delete category by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/83dc6895-4f59-4670-9227-4f7e0b84c84a
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenSuperAdmin}}


### Create new category
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenSuperAdmin}}

{
    "name": "abdul talif dummy data",
    "parent_id": "cdbd1e74-51f3-4db0-94b0-442acf720e5c",
    "icon": "test",
    "status": true,
    "description": "test"
}

### Update new category
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/3c2d0f25-38c4-42d1-8f60-d1dcf1c28ae2
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenSuperAdmin}}

{
    "icon": "Adik kecil",
    "name": "Siti Parinduri"
}

### Get category by slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/siti-parinduri/slug
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenSuperAdmin}}